<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>be.syntaxya.lodica</id>
  <name>Lodica</name>
  <summary>Private browser with built-in search, mail, chat and authenticator</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <developer id="be.syntaxya"><name>Lodica contributors</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>Lodica is a browser that keeps your searches, mail, chat and one-time codes on a server you control.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Lodica Search, or the search engine of your choice</li>
      <li>Built-in ad and tracker blocking</li>
      <li>Authenticator codes that fill in by themselves</li>
      <li>Themes, including your system colours</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
